    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Per-tensor linear quantization of a FLOAT input <computeroutput>x</computeroutput> to an 8-bit integer output. The output element type is taken from <computeroutput>y_zero_point</computeroutput> (UINT8 or INT8); if <computeroutput>y_zero_point</computeroutput> is omitted the output is UINT8 with a zero point of 0. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
